        "title": "Divide fractions",
        "text": "Apply $$\\frac{\\frac{a}{b}}{\\frac{c}{d}}=\\frac{ad}{bc}$$ where $$a=2$$, $$b=7x+1$$, $$c=x$$, and $$d=4x+1$$.",
